us":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m010-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"以下","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名群體、族屬、學說合稱或匿名說話者保持未定；不將黃老儒墨自動拆為人名，也不補群體成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m010-0042","start":42,"end":46,"surface":"諸侯賓客","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名群體、族屬、學說合稱或匿名說話者保持未定；不將黃老儒墨自動拆為人名，也不補群體成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m010-0051","start":51,"end":55,"surface":"天下賢士","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名群體、族屬、學說合稱或匿名說話者保持未定；不將黃老儒墨自動拆為人名，也不補群體成員。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun","book_id":"b-shiji-074","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-074-mengxun"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:p011","text":"荀卿，趙人。年五十始來游學於齊。騶衍之術迂大而閎辯；奭也文具難施；淳于髡久與處，時有得善言。故齊人頌曰：「談天衍，雕龍奭，炙轂過髡。」田駢之屬皆已死齊襄王時，而荀卿最為老師。齊尚修列大夫之缺，而荀卿三為祭酒焉。齊人或讒荀卿，荀卿乃適楚，而春申君以為蘭陵令。春申君死而荀卿廢，因家蘭陵。李斯嘗為弟子，已而相秦。荀卿嫉濁世之政，亡國亂君相屬，不遂大道而營於巫祝，信禨祥，鄙儒小拘，如莊周等又猾稽亂俗，於是推儒、墨、道德之行事興壞，序列著數萬言而卒。因葬蘭陵。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m011-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"荀卿","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004318","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m011-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"騶衍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004291","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m011-0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"奭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004311","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m011-0033","start":33,"end":36,"surface":"淳于髡","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004306","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m011-0055","start":55,"end":56,"surface":"衍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004291","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m011-0059","start":59,"end":60,"surface":"奭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004311","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m011-